stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738.0 Td (understood before they are measured or managed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 718.0 Td (For every system, stewards document the intended use, purpose, deployment context, and out-of-scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 704.0 Td (uses. For example, Aruba AI network insights is scoped to anomaly detection and optimization) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690.0 Td (recommendations for network operators, not autonomous enforcement; HPEFS fraud detection is scoped) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 676.0 Td (to decision support with mandatory human review of adverse actions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656.0 Td (Each system is then subject to risk categorization using a tiered model:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 636.0 Td (| Risk Tier | Description | Examples |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 623.0 Td (| ----------- | ------------- | ---------- |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 610.0 Td (| High-risk | Decisions materially affecting individuals, finances, or safety | HPEFS fraud detection |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 597.0 Td (| Moderate | Operational decisions with human oversight | GreenLake AIOps, Aruba AI insights |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 584.0 Td (| Limited | Low-impact assistive or internal tooling | Ezmeral ML internal pipelines |) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 565.0 Td (Tiering considers impact and harm potential, bias and fairness exposure, discrimination risk, safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 551.0 Td (implications, and affected-stakeholder scope. As part of MAP, teams conduct a stakeholder analysis) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 537.0 Td (identifying end users, data subjects, customers, and affected communities, and perform an initial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 523.0 Td (impact and bias assessment to surface potential harms early. Higher tiers trigger deeper scrutiny,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 509.0 Td (mandatory human oversight, and Committee-level approval.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 489.0 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 463.0 Td (MEASURE - Metrics, Testing, and Assurance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 440.0 Td (The MEASURE function quantifies trustworthiness through analytic, empirical, and adversarial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 426.0 Td (evaluation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 406.0 Td (Each system is evaluated against defined metrics and benchmarks appropriate to its purpose:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 392.0 Td (accuracy, precision/recall, false-positive rates \(critical for HPEFS fraud detection\), latency, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 378.0 Td (fairness metrics disaggregated across relevant population groups to detect bias and discrimination.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 364.0 Td (Results are compared against pre-registered acceptance thresholds before deployment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 344.0 Td (HPE applies structured testing, validation, and verification, including:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 324.0 Td (- Red-teaming and adversarial testing for robustness, mapped to the OWASP LLM Top 10 and MITRE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 310.0 Td (  ATLAS threat frameworks, especially for generative and LLM-backed features in GreenLake AIOps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 296.0 Td (- Robustness and stress testing against edge cases, distribution shift, and adversarial inputs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 282.0 Td (- Independent validation by AI Risk & Compliance, producing assurance evidence and an audit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 268.0 Td (  trail for each release.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 248.0 Td (All measurement results, test reports, and validation sign-offs are retained as audit evidence in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 234.0 Td (the model registry, enabling internal and external audit on demand.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 214.0 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 188.0 Td (MANAGE - Risk Response, Monitoring, and Incident Handling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 165.0 Td (The MANAGE function prioritizes and treats identified risks and sustains trustworthiness in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 151.0 Td (production.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 131.0 Td (Risk response follows a treatment hierarchy - mitigate, transfer, avoid, or accept - with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 117.0 Td (residual-risk acceptance requiring sign-off proportional to the risk tier. Controls and remediation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 103.0 Td (actions are tracked to closure in the risk register.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 83.0 Td (Continuous monitoring is mandatory in production. HPE monitors model performance, accuracy, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 69.0 Td (drift \(data drift and concept drift\), fairness stability, and operational health. Threshold breaches) Tj ET
