BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738.0 Td (- for example, degradation in Aruba AI insights or rising false negatives in HPEFS fraud detection -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 724.0 Td (trigger automated alerts and defined escalation.) Tj ET
