BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690.0 Td (approve adverse or high-impact decisions, and every deployed system provides an override and kill) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 676.0 Td (switch capability allowing operators to suspend or roll back the model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656.0 Td (AI incident response is governed by dedicated playbooks integrated with HPE's Security Operations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 642.0 Td (Incidents - model failures, harmful outputs, bias events, or adversarial compromise - are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628.0 Td (classified, escalated, contained, and reported per severity, with regulator and customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 614.0 Td (notification where required.) Tj ET
